---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="高校风云 · 真人匹配与 AI 对战" description="执掌一所高校，穿越六个时代。真人优先匹配，空位由策略 AI 补齐，也可立即开始 AI 练习。">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="gxf-online">
    <header class="gxf-hero"><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">高校风云 / UNIVERSITY CHRONICLES</p><h1>下一所世界一流，<br/><span>由你执掌。</span></h1><p>从 1990 到 2050，在学科建设、人才竞争与国家工程之间，写下你的校史。</p></div><div class="gxf-seal" aria-hidden="true">高校<br/>风云<small>1990—2050</small></div></header>
    <section class="gxf-lobby gxf-panel" id="lobby" aria-labelledby="lobby-title">
      <div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">ONLINE PLAY · 快速对战</p><h2 id="lobby-title">和真人相遇，随时有 AI 同桌</h2><p>匹配等待 20 秒，优先邀请同时排队的真人；满桌立即开始，空位由 AI 补齐。</p></div>
      <form id="match-form" class="gxf-form">
        <label>你的昵称<input id="nickname" name="nickname" maxlength="16" required autocomplete="nickname" placeholder="例如：知行校长" /></label>
        <label>选择高校<select id="school" name="school" required><option value="">正在载入高校…</option></select></label>
        <label>同桌人数<select id="table-size" name="size"><option value="3">3 人</option><option value="4" selected>4 人 · 推荐</option><option value="5">5 人</option><option value="6">6 人</option></select></label>
        <div class="gxf-buttons"><button id="match" type="submit" class="gxf-primary" disabled>开始匹配</button><button id="practice" type="button" disabled>与 AI 练习</button></div>
      </form>
      <p id="school-preview" class="gxf-muted"></p><p id="service-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在连接游戏服务…</p>
      <details class="gxf-rules"><summary>开局须知 · 本次采用哪些规则？</summary>
        <p>这是基于 v0.5 的线上快速对战。3–6 人、六个时代；先免费申报，再按生源顺序轮流使用每人 4 AP。AI 与真人共享院系和人才市场，执行同样的行动和资源校验。</p>
        <p>已启用：院系建设、升级、科研、工科转型、定价招募、招生、智库、双向确认调档、工程前二分配、认证与评估。预算生源加成自动分配；工程主导奖励统一为匹配院系 +1 强度，协同牵头 +1🔬，第二名 +1🏛。</p>
        <p>与实体规则的差异：人才使用定价招募；事件从已自动化的 24 张中抽取；政策牌、人才拍卖/挖角、联盟合标、合并/拆分及大部分高校独有技能尚未启用。完整 336 张卡牌仍可在下方查阅，档案里的全文不代表全部已自动执行。</p>
        <p>每次操作限时 90 秒，超时由 AI 临时托管，可恢复操作；刷新网页可重连。离开对局会交给 AI，无法再加入这一局。匹配到相同高校时，后加入者会获分配另一所高校。</p>
        <a href="/assets/games/gaoxiao-fengyun/data/高校风云-游戏规则-v0.5.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">阅读实体 v0.5 规则全文 ↗</a>
      </details>
    </section>
    <section id="queue" class="gxf-panel gxf-queue" hidden aria-label="匹配中"><span class="gxf-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>正在寻找同桌校长</h2><p id="queue-summary" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="queue-names"></p><strong id="queue-timer"></strong><p>剩余席位将在倒计时结束后由 AI 补齐。</p><button id="cancel-match">取消匹配</button></section>
    <p id="game-error" class="gxf-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
    <section id="room" hidden aria-labelledby="room-title">
      <header class="gxf-room-header gxf-panel"><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow" id="room-code"></p><h2 id="room-title">1990s · 初始申报</h2><p id="turn-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="gxf-room-tools"><strong id="turn-timer"></strong><button id="resume" hidden>恢复操作</button><button id="leave-room">离开对局</button></div></header>
      <div id="players" class="gxf-players"></div>
      <section id="results" class="gxf-panel" hidden><h2>校史终章 · 对局结果</h2><div id="result-table"></div><button id="play-again" class="gxf-primary">再来一局</button></section>
      <div class="gxf-game-grid">
        <aside class="gxf-panel gxf-actions" id="action-panel"><p class="gxf-eyebrow">YOUR DECISION</p><h2>校务决策</h2><p id="action-hint"></p><label>行动类别<select id="action-type"></select></label><label>选择行动<select id="action-choice"></select></label><p id="action-description"></p><button id="execute" class="gxf-primary" disabled>执行行动</button><button id="pass" disabled>结束本时代的行动</button><p class="gxf-muted">只展示当前可执行、且资源足够的行动。免费申报窗口关闭后不能补用。</p></aside>
        <div class="gxf-table">
          <section class="gxf-panel"><h2>时代风向</h2><div id="events" class="gxf-events"></div></section>
          <section class="gxf-panel"><h2>国家重大工程 <small>每人最多参与 2 项</small></h2><div id="projects" class="gxf-projects"></div></section>
          <section class="gxf-panel"><h2>我的校园</h2><div id="campus" class="gxf-campus"></div></section>
          <section class="gxf-panel"><h2>共享市场</h2><h3>院系</h3><div id="faculty-market" class="gxf-market"></div><h3>人才 · 定价招募</h3><div id="talent-market" class="gxf-market"></div></section>
          <section class="gxf-panel" id="transfers-panel" hidden><h2>跨校调档</h2><div id="transfers"></div></section>
          <details class="gxf-panel" open><summary>校史记录</summary><ol id="game-log"></ol></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="gxf-archive gxf-panel" aria-labelledby="archive-title">
      <div class="gxf-archive-header"><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">CARD ARCHIVE</p><h2 id="archive-title">336 张卡牌，完整查阅</h2></div><p>高校 48 · 院系 96 · 人才 36<br/>事件 72 · 国家工程 60 · 政策 24</p></div>
      <div class="gxf-archive-filters"><label>牌类<select id="archive-type"><option value="all">全部卡牌</option><option value="school">高校</option><option value="faculty">院系</option><option value="talent">人才</option><option value="event">事件</option><option value="project">国家工程</option><option value="policy">政策</option></select></label><label>搜索<input id="archive-search" type="search" placeholder="学校、门类、航天…"/></label></div>
      <p id="archive-count" class="gxf-muted"></p><div id="archive-grid" class="gxf-archive-grid"></div><button id="more-cards">显示更多</button>
    </section>
    <dialog id="card-dialog"><button id="close-card" aria-label="关闭卡牌详情">关闭 ×</button><div id="card-detail"></div></dialog>
    <dialog id="leave-dialog"><h2>将本局交给 AI？</h2><p>退出后将由 AI 接替你完成这一局，你可以重新匹配。仅刷新网页可以重连，不必退出。</p><div class="gxf-buttons"><button id="keep-playing">继续游戏</button><button id="confirm-leave">退出并交给 AI</button></div></dialog>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/games/gaoxiao-fengyun/online.css" />
  <script is:inline type="module" src="/assets/games/gaoxiao-fengyun/online.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
